  'pergolas.faq.2.a': 'A bioclimatic pergola is a fixed aluminium structure with adjustable louvres that lets you regulate light and ventilation. Unlike an awning, it offers rain protection, can be used 365 days a year and increases the value of your property. An awning is more affordable and flexible, but does not offer complete protection.',
