  'about.story.heading': 'Our Story',
  'about.story.paragraph1': 'Optim Toldos was founded in 2009 in Elche with a clear mission: to offer the highest quality solar protection and outdoor living solutions at competitive prices. From the very beginning, we have specialised in understanding the unique needs of the Mediterranean climate and the outdoor lifestyle that defines the Costa Blanca.',
  'about.story.paragraph2': 'Today, with over 2,000 installations completed across the province of Alicante, we remain true to our commitment: custom-made products, professional installation and an after-sales service that sets us apart.',
